    <presentation>
      <material><mattext texttype="text/html">A B 0 Read the sentence from a school-news article and choose the words that make the account accurate. After a three-week pilot, the cafeteria team reported that the reusable tray program reduced lunchroom waste increased disposable packaging left trash levels unchanged stopped food donations , and the strongest evidence was the number of students who bought lunch drop in bags collected after lunch color of the new trays menu posted on Monday . 1 1</mattext></material>
      
      
